        "# Context\n",
        "\n",
        "A context holds the current values of context variables. Contexts allow values to follow asynchronous tasks independently rather than being shared indiscriminately between them.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-context)"
      ]
    }
